gbfZ(){return"Winds need your breath. Woodwinds like the flute, clarinet and saxophone; brass like the trumpet, trombone and tuba."},
gbfW(){return"Percussion is struck \u2014 drums, xylophone and triangle. Keyboards like the piano and organ play many notes at once."},
